                                "sense_id": "183ffeb1-5f17-3837-a6af-a4891e98e303",
                                "text": "But it would have been so nice to have a private income, and to be able sometimes to go to Venezia, Firenze, Roma, those places with the beautiful names."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "469d2687-977e-4bd9-a59c-88688f81a897",
                                "sense_id": "183ffeb1-5f17-3837-a6af-a4891e98e303",
                                "text": "When you plan your first visit to Italy, you will likely put Roma, Firenze, and Venezia at the top of your list, perhaps adding Milano and Napoli as well. These destinations make sense because they are all world-class cities with great history, art, architecture, culture, and food."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "72f456ad-fdba-49e5-a539-302d1891e2a8",
                                "sense_id": "183ffeb1-5f17-3837-a6af-a4891e98e303",
                                "text": "His black slacks were the handiwork of his British tailor of a wool-and-Angora blend; his thick-soled shoes were made in Firenze of black leather, and fitted more like gloves than shoes."
                            }
                        ]
